# Butler Routes - Darkshore rares and treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 18 confirmed rares and the fixed world containers
# of Darkshore. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end of the core route or
# standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not up never holds the route.
# Spawn points, levels and loot are the local Forever game data (questie-forever);
# respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so none are stated. Named mobs that are
# core-route quest objectives (Murkdeep, Volcor, Den Mother, Jai'vhanel, Balthule
# Shadowstrike and his Tower chain, Gelkak and his crew, the beached-creature
# series and every other contracted quest subject) are NOT here: the core guide
# covers their quests. The Ghost Saber is summoned at the cat figurines, not a
# roaming spawn — her step loops the figurines. See
# docs/darkshore-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory this guide was
# built against.
guide butler-routes-completionist/darkshore-rares
title Darkshore - Rares & Treasures
levels 10-20
zone Darkshore
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords darkshore, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Strider Clutchmother — the southern shore

  goto 34.82,87.31
  kill 2172 optional
  task "Tame it instead of killing it" optional only Hunter
  collect 284176 "Tallstrider Hatchling" optional
  note Level 20 rare tallstrider; her table holds Strider Meat, so hunters can tame instead. The Hatchling drops only from her.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Calico Cloak, Warped Leather Bracers); respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Shadowclaw — central Darkshore

  goto 40.29,40.52
  kill 2175 optional
  task "Tame it instead of killing it" optional only Hunter
  collect 284174 "Serrated Shadowclaw" optional
  note Level 13 rare stealthed cat; her table holds a Small Furry Paw, so hunters can tame instead. Her namesake claw drops only from her.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Dwarven Hatchet, Priest's Mace); respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Ghost Saber — the Ruins of Mathystra

  loop
  goto 59.49,23.38
  goto 60.09,15.24
  goto 61.17,21.63
  goto 56.86,21.48
  interact 13359 optional
  interact 13873 optional
  task "Tame it the moment it appears" optional only Hunter
  collect 5332 "Glowing Cat Figurine" optional
  note Level 19 rare; she is NOT a roaming spawn — interacting with a cat figurine summons her and she despawns after a while, so tame on sight. Her Glowing Cat Figurine drops only from her.
  note Spawn points, levels and loot are the data; the summon-and-despawn mechanic is the brief's report. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

