step Lady Sedorax — the east

  loop
  goto 55.2,35.2
  goto 55.4,36.2
  goto 55.4,36.8
  goto 55.6,35.2
  kill 210451 optional
  collect 209028 "Spell Notes: BIVOLG NIMB" optional
  note Level 18 rare. Her Spell Notes drop only from her; her Rune of Endless Rage is shared with seven others per the item data — no collect goal, take it if it drops. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

