step Delmanis the Hated — by the Tower of Althalaxx

  goto 56.84,27.51
  kill 3662 optional
  note Level 17 rare. The data records no signature loot on him and no quest link — only ordinary goods (Stout Battlehammer, Forester's Axe); respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Lunaclaw — central Darkshore

  goto 42.8,45
  kill 12138 optional
  task "Tame it instead of killing it" optional only Hunter
  note Level 12 rare bear; his table holds Haunch of Meat, so hunters can tame instead. The data records no signature loot on him.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Calico Shoes, Calico Cloak); respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Shade of Elura — the coast

  goto 31.64,44.86
  kill 6133 optional
  collect 6809 "Elura's Medallion" optional
  note Level 11 rare; her Medallion drops only from her. It is sought by Elanaria's Darnassus-city quest The Shade of Elura (1686, Warrior-only, NOT in the core contract — a city-chain quest the core route does not cover, so take it if you hold that quest).
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Calico Shoes, Calico Cloak); respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Baron Marinous — the Mathystra coast

  loop
  goto 57.59,20.83
  goto 58.07,23.85
  goto 58.85,23.96
  goto 59.04,21.74
  goto 59.17,22.7
