  goto 59.67,22.78
  goto 59.94,16.49
  goto 59.98,23.32
  goto 60,21.88
  goto 60.21,22.78
  kill 270294 optional
  collect 279275 "Clouded Water Globe" optional
  note Level 21 rare, above the band but a true coastal rare with his own loot — his Globe drops only from him. The Globe starts the contracted core quest Baron Marinous (98028, turn in to Onu at the Grove), so take it if it drops and hand it in — the core route covers the quest and never waits on the drop.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

